  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds memory access from an unbounded stack\n     allocation in the SPIR-V front end (ELSCVE-171724)\n     - debian/patches/backport-STACK_ARRAY.patch: add the upstream\n       src/util/stack_array.h helper, which the fix requires.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-40393.patch: replace NIR_VLA, a bare alloca,\n       with STACK_ARRAY at the two sites whose element count comes from the\n       shader, in src/compiler/spirv/spirv_to_nir.c and\n       src/compiler/nir/nir_inline_functions.c.\n     - CVE-2026-40393",
